    description: "Build a post-hoc analyzer that, given a session's transcript and its paired .last_injection_history.jsonl, computes the overlap between (a) playbooks the agent explicitly read via the Read tool and (b) playbooks that were subsequently injected by the on_transcript_change pipeline (or vice versa). The overlap is pure waste — the agent already has the content. Output a per-session waste rate and a top-N list of playbooks that thrash this loop. Surface the result in the agentic-session-retrospective playbook (Phase 2d) once available. Per ADR-0018 (2026-04-08 amendment) Future Work."  # 4ac9
